<title>USA: Woolworth December same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Woolworth December same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolworth Corp Thursday reported sales for the five week and 48 week periods ended January 4.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $1,196     $1,190	+0.4	 +0.6</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $7,575     $7,623	-0.6	 +0.4</p>
<p>&quot;Excluding the effect of translation rates, particularly as related to our German operations, sales for the five-week period increased 1.6 percent and sales for the 48 week period increased 0.6 percent,&quot; Woolworth said.</p>
<p>Sales of businesses disposed of during 1995 and 1996 have been excluded from all calculations.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
